    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939450/extras/4a83e1b24b12d902f7baa517190abd0b.poster.avif?t=1752935902\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939450/extras/4a83e1b24b12d902f7baa517190abd0b.webm?t=1752935902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939450/extras/4a83e1b24b12d902f7baa517190abd0b.mp4?t=1752935902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the classics of the genre, <i>Inherited Shadows</i> weaves a gripping tale about Amanda, a young adult struggling to lead a normal life while haunted by the trauma of her mother\u2019s absence, but on an ordinary morning in 1999, everything will change for her forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A TRUE HORROR ADVENTURE</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world where tension never goes away. Every step is a life or death decision. Hide, solve puzzles and discover the dark secrets of a cult you were never meant to find. With an oppressive atmosphere, relentless enemies and a disturbing story, this is a true horror adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939450/extras/2889a796e520a534cf127cff009d2a44.poster.avif?t=1752935902\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939450/extras/2889a796e520a534cf127cff009d2a44.webm?t=1752935902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939450/extras/2889a796e520a534cf127cff009d2a44.mp4?t=1752935902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SOME QUESTIONS ARE BETTER LEFT UNANSWERED</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything in Inherited Shadows has a logical explanation. Between visions, whispers and fragmented memories, Amanda must confront her own mind as she discovers the truth about her past. But... do you really want to know all the answers? Some truths are more terrifying than ignorance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amanda\u2019s past is shrouded in darkness, and only you can guide her through the horror. Explore, survive, and face what lurks in the shadows. <i>Inherited Shadows</i> awaits\u2026 if you dare to enter.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939450/extras/4a83e1b24b12d902f7baa517190abd0b.poster.avif?t=1752935902\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939450/extras/4a83e1b24b12d902f7baa517190abd0b.webm?t=1752935902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939450/extras/4a83e1b24b12d902f7baa517190abd0b.mp4?t=1752935902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the classics of the genre, <i>Inherited Shadows</i> weaves a gripping tale about Amanda, a young adult struggling to lead a normal life while haunted by the trauma of her mother\u2019s absence, but on an ordinary morning in 1999, everything will change for her forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A TRUE HORROR ADVENTURE</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world where tension never goes away. Every step is a life or death decision. Hide, solve puzzles and discover the dark secrets of a cult you were never meant to find. With an oppressive atmosphere, relentless enemies and a disturbing story, this is a true horror adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939450/extras/2889a796e520a534cf127cff009d2a44.poster.avif?t=1752935902\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939450/extras/2889a796e520a534cf127cff009d2a44.webm?t=1752935902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939450/extras/2889a796e520a534cf127cff009d2a44.mp4?t=1752935902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SOME QUESTIONS ARE BETTER LEFT UNANSWERED</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything in Inherited Shadows has a logical explanation. Between visions, whispers and fragmented memories, Amanda must confront her own mind as she discovers the truth about her past. But... do you really want to know all the answers? Some truths are more terrifying than ignorance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amanda\u2019s past is shrouded in darkness, and only you can guide her through the horror. Explore, survive, and face what lurks in the shadows. <i>Inherited Shadows</i> awaits\u2026 if you dare to enter.</p>",
